          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Each family directory is optional. You only need to create a family directory if you have source files that should be stored in a specific family directory. That is, if a module doesn’t have any image files, don’t create an "
